 Native tools may be required. In the inspected code, reset(seed=...) seeds Gymnasium but does not set NetHack RNGs; use the explicit seed interface. NetHackChallenge deliberately disallows seed changes. Terminal/glyph observations are not RGB game frames.","limitations","guidance","list","Setup","ordered",true,"items",[73,74,75],"setup","Prepare Python 3.10+, CMake 3.28+ and the platform build prerequisites documented upstream.","Install nle, then run python -m nle.scripts.play --mode random.","Create NetHackScore-v0 with fixed observation_keys, actions and fix_moon_phase=True; before reset, call env.unwrapped.seed with recorded core, disp, reseed=False and optional lgen values.","Try these tasks",false,[80,81,82],"testTasks","Measure staircase or score-task progress with a fixed turn budget.","Test inventory decisions and recovery after invalid actions.","Modify a task reward or termination rule and replay baseline rollouts.","AI use and evaluation boundary","An AI research interface; distinguish terminal rendering, symbols, text messages and internal state so planning results remain comparable.","aiUseNote","links","Supporting evidence",[90,91,92],"evidence",{"_54":97,"_25":98},{"_54":95,"_25":96},{"_54":93,"_25":94},"Pinned observation, seed and reset implementation","https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle/blob/2319f2989f0035685017e9ea13c83b2546fe477c/nle/env/base.py","Archived upstream repository","https://github.com/facebookresearch/nle","Maintained source, installation and play scripts","https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle#readme","Read the terms",[102],"licenseUrl",{"_54":99,"_25":103},"https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle/blob/main/LICENSE","Terms category","Open-license sources","terms","provenance","Asset license","Bundled NetHack data follows repository notices; external tilesets are separate.","assetLicense","Code license","NetHack General Public License; preserve notices and follow source/distribution obligations.","codeLicense","Get started",[117],"access",{"_5